        "original_id": "6d3777d9-80d0-58de-8058-db562abb12c0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: \"Computech\"\n- People: Turbonegro\n- Places: Norway\n- Concepts: punk rock\n\nFacts:\n- Turbonegro is a Norwegian punk rock band known as Turboneger in Norway.\n- Turbonegro was initially active from 1989 to 1998 and reformed in 2002.\n- \"Computech\" is a single by Turbonegro that was recorded at the band's first rehearsal in January 1989.\n- \"Computech\" was released on cassette tape in 1989.\n- Only 50 copies of \"Computech\" were made, although some sources say 100 copies were made.",
